# gather. — Roadmap Hooks Reference

Version 1.0 | Schema fields that exist now but have no v1 UI

The fields and tables in this document are intentionally dormant. They exist in the schema so future features have clean data to work with. Do not build UI for any of these in v1. Do not remove them from the schema.

---

## Dormant fields (exist on v1 tables, no UI yet)

| Field | Table | Type | What it enables | When to activate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| engagement_score | membership | float | Scores how engaged a member is based on activity — RSVPs, memory uploads, comms opens | After 6 months of real usage data |
| involvement_rung | membership | int | Ladder from passive member to active leader — used for giving and volunteer asks | After engagement scoring is running |
| giving_interest | person | boolean | Self-selected flag — member has indicated interest in giving/donations. Never inferred. | Separate product phase (endowment/giving feature) |
| verification_config | tenant | jsonb | Question bank and auto-approval rules for join verification | After manual approval workflow is stable |
| trust_score | join_request | float | AI-assisted confidence score for join request legitimacy | After verification_config is built |
| discoverable | vendor_profile | boolean | Whether vendor appears in the public marketplace directory | When vendor marketplace launches |
| avg_rating | vendor_profile | float | Aggregate rating from vendor bookings | When vendor marketplace launches |

