## Dormant tables (exist in schema, no UI yet)

| Table | What it enables | When to activate |
|---|---|---|
| notification_trigger | Rules that watch the activity_event stream and fire outbound notifications automatically (e.g. "71 members haven't opened invitation — send reminder") | v1.5, after manual nudge on dashboard is validated |
| vendor_profile | Public vendor directory — caterers, venues, photographers who want to be discovered by reunion orgs | After 20+ vendor bookings exist in the system organically |
| org_group | Parent org structure — national fraternities, school districts, family associations that manage multiple tenants | When first national org signs up |
